<Base>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <div class="bg-white min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 md:px-6 lg:px-8 py-20 md:py-28">


      <!-- Main Heading -->
      <h1 class="text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-gray-900 text-center mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
        Server Islands
      </h1>

      <!-- Subheading -->
      <p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 text-center mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Flexible components, consistent caching, quick development, easy integration.
      </p>

      <!-- Explanation -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 leading-relaxed">
          Astro Server Islands enable you to build faster, more efficient web applications by allowing each component to have its own independent cache strategy. 
          This means you can optimize performance per component-fast-changing data gets short cache times, while stable content can be cached longer, 
          resulting in lightning-fast page loads and optimal user experiences.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
